  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You thought that I would be so hurt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And guess I was for maybe a week or so",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It's kinda crazy what I learned",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Should've listened to your exes when they said, \"Don't\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You take all your issues",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Blame 'em on everyone else",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I bet that if you could you'd go on a date with yourself",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh, you think that you're so fucking cool (So cool)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Got a new girl and some new tattoos",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah, way too fucking cool (Too cool)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But all your best friends really hate you too",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Every time I hear your name, why's it make me sick?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Ooh, it's driving me insane that I'm not over it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I can't seem to get away from you (From you)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I would say \"Hi\", but you're way too fucking cool",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Hit me up on my birthday",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I didn't ask but you told me you're doing well",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah, any way to control me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Uh, making up feelings you never felt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
